meta {
  name: check providers
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/providers/check
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  ~provider: all
}

docs {
  Runs a bounded check (5 s outer budget) and answers the rows. A provider that accepts the connection and never answers reads failed with reason timeout. Unknown provider id answers 400.
  
  Fence: host+origin. Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: yes
}
